<https://top.scientix.ai/v1#satisfiesConstraint> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Links the Outcome to the Constraint(s) it has been validated against."@en .
<https://top.scientix.ai/v1#satisfiesConstraint> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://top.scientix.ai/v1#Outcome> .
<https://top.scientix.ai/v1#satisfiesConstraint> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "satisfies constraint"@en .
