<https://top.scientix.ai/v1#signedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Links the Evidence to the Agent who attested to its truth. E-signature semantics (21 CFR Part 11) and PROV attribution."@en .
<https://top.scientix.ai/v1#signedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://top.scientix.ai/v1#Evidence> .
<https://top.scientix.ai/v1#signedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "signed by"@en .
