<https://top.scientix.ai/v1#sourceContext> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The retrieved context passages (e.g. SPARQL results, vector-search snippets) injected into the prompt. Stored verbatim. See the PII scope note in this module's header." .
<https://top.scientix.ai/v1#sourceContext> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://top.scientix.ai/v1#Conclusion> .
<https://top.scientix.ai/v1#sourceContext> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "source context"@en .
<https://top.scientix.ai/v1#sourceContext> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://top.scientix.ai/v1#sourceContext> <https://top.scientix.ai/v1#flavor> "Additive" .
<https://top.scientix.ai/v1#startTime> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<https://top.scientix.ai/v1#startTime> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Actual or planned start. PROV-aligned to prov:startedAtTime."@en .
<https://top.scientix.ai/v1#startTime> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://top.scientix.ai/v1#Temporal> .
<https://top.scientix.ai/v1#startTime> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "start time"@en .
<https://top.scientix.ai/v1#startTime> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
<https://top.scientix.ai/v1#startTime> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#startedAtTime> .
<https://top.scientix.ai/v1#startTime> <https://top.scientix.ai/v1#flavor> "Invariant" .
<https://top.scientix.ai/v1#status> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<https://top.scientix.ai/v1#status> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Current lifecycle / health state. Each Category narrows the enum at its layer; leaves narrow further. Universal at this layer because every entity has SOME state and the project-wide status query is operationally meaningful."@en .
<https://top.scientix.ai/v1#status> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://top.scientix.ai/v1#CommonEntity> .
<https://top.scientix.ai/v1#status> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "status"@en .
<https://top.scientix.ai/v1#status> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://top.scientix.ai/v1#status> <https://top.scientix.ai/v1#flavor> "Tightenable" .
<https://top.scientix.ai/v1#supersededAt> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<https://top.scientix.ai/v1#supersededAt> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Transaction time (append-only): when a later assertion superseded this one. A correction is a NEW assertion carrying its own recordedAt; this timestamp closes the old one and is never rewritten."@en .
<https://top.scientix.ai/v1#supersededAt> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "superseded at"@en .
<https://top.scientix.ai/v1#supersededAt> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
<https://top.scientix.ai/v1#supersededAt> <https://top.scientix.ai/v1#flavor> "Invariant" .
<https://top.scientix.ai/v1#validFrom> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<https://top.scientix.ai/v1#validFrom> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Domain intentionally open: rdfs:domain is an inference axiom, not a constraint — a domain of top:Versioned would retype every dated entity as Versioned and drag it under the versioning contract (the RDFS target cascade). The requirement side lives in SHACL: top:BitemporalShape demands validFrom on Versioned."@en .
<https://top.scientix.ai/v1#validFrom> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Start of the valid-time interval — when this version's state became true in the world. Distinct from top:observedAt (transaction time). Invariant per ADR-0019, like top:startTime/top:endTime. No PROV-O peer: PROV models system time, not valid-time-of-a-fact (declared absence, per ADR-0021)."@en .
<https://top.scientix.ai/v1#validFrom> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "valid from"@en .
<https://top.scientix.ai/v1#validFrom> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
<https://top.scientix.ai/v1#validFrom> <https://top.scientix.ai/v1#flavor> "Invariant" .
<https://top.scientix.ai/v1#validUntil> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<https://top.scientix.ai/v1#validUntil> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "End of the valid-time interval; open (absent) for the currently-valid version. Invariant per ADR-0019."@en .
<https://top.scientix.ai/v1#validUntil> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "valid until"@en .
<https://top.scientix.ai/v1#validUntil> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
<https://top.scientix.ai/v1#validUntil> <https://top.scientix.ai/v1#flavor> "Invariant" .
<https://top.scientix.ai/v1#variance> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<https://top.scientix.ai/v1#variance> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Delta between expected and actual. Format depends on leaf specialization."@en .
<https://top.scientix.ai/v1#variance> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://top.scientix.ai/v1#Outcome> .
<https://top.scientix.ai/v1#variance> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "variance"@en .
<https://top.scientix.ai/v1#variance> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://top.scientix.ai/v1#variance> <https://top.scientix.ai/v1#flavor> "Tightenable" .
<https://top.scientix.ai/v1#verifiesOutcome> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://top.scientix.ai/v1#verifiesOutcome> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Direct link to the Outcome this Evidence supports."@en .
<https://top.scientix.ai/v1#verifiesOutcome> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://top.scientix.ai/v1#Evidence> .
<https://top.scientix.ai/v1#verifiesOutcome> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "verifies outcome"@en .
<https://top.scientix.ai/v1#verifiesOutcome> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://top.scientix.ai/v1#Outcome> .
<https://top.scientix.ai/v1#verifiesOutcome> <https://top.scientix.ai/v1#flavor> "Tightenable" .
<https://top.scientix.ai/v1#withinLocation> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://top.scientix.ai/v1#withinLocation> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#TransitiveProperty> .
<https://top.scientix.ai/v1#withinLocation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Recursive parent location. Transitive: Room within Building within Campus is queryable as Room within Campus."@en .
<https://top.scientix.ai/v1#withinLocation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://top.scientix.ai/v1#Location> .
<https://top.scientix.ai/v1#withinLocation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "within location"@en .
